Shaun! Shaun! Shaun.

990
01:06:49,083 --> 01:06:51,458
Shaun, Shaun,
Shaun, Shaun.
Over here.

991
01:06:52,083 --> 01:06:54,417
-Ahhh!
-Sorry.

992
01:06:54,417 --> 01:06:58,542
-Ow! God! Dick!
-Sorry.

993
