to be a writer.

1125
01:15:32,917 --> 01:15:35,875
All I need
are the people
who inspire me,

1126
01:15:36,750 --> 01:15:38,250
like my friends...

1127
01:15:40,083 --> 01:15:41,625
And my family...

1128
01:15:45,917 --> 01:15:47,250
And you.

1129
01:15:49,333 --> 01:15:54,000
So I'm gonna stay.
I'm gonna stay
in Orange County.

1130
01:15:54,000 --> 01:15:58,333
-You are!
